  "translation": "Long wanem Selomon i wokim wanpela platform bilong kopa, wantaim i putim ⟨em⟩ long namel bilong ples: faipela kubit long longpela bilong en, na faipela kubit long lap bilong en, na tripela kubit long maunten bilong en; na i sanap long em, na i go daun long tupela kne bilong em, long fes bilong olgeta lain bilong Yisrael, na i opim ol han bilong em i go long heven.",
